1
00:00:00,974 --> 00:00:03,704
(Sheldon:)Well... I'm responding to it.

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,310
(Leonard:)Uh, don't lower yourself
to their level.

3
00:00:05,312 --> 00:00:06,912
(Sheldon:)Look, I am simply

4
00:00:06,914 --> 00:00:09,284
(Sheldon:)going to defend our work,
scientist to scientist.

5
00:00:09,283 --> 00:00:10,753
(Sheldon:)And failing that,

6
00:00:10,751 --> 00:00:12,781
(Sheldon:)suggest that his mother enjoys
a string

7
00:00:12,786 --> 00:00:15,716
(Sheldon:)of both human
and non-human lovers.

8
00:00:15,722 --> 00:00:18,822
(Leonard:)Sheldon, my name's
on that paper, too.

9
00:00:18,826 --> 00:00:20,326
(Leonard:)There's no upside to doing this.

10
00:00:20,327 --> 00:00:21,797
(Sheldon:)He just left another comment.

11
00:00:21,795 --> 00:00:23,795
(Raj:)What does it say?

12
00:00:23,797 --> 00:00:26,967
"Upon review, I've
changed my mind about

13
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:28,267
"the Cooper-Hofstadter
hypothesis

14
00:00:28,268 --> 00:00:30,798
"that space-time is like
a superfluid. In fact,

15
00:00:30,804 --> 00:00:33,944
"it's inspired me to come up
with my own theory.

16
00:00:33,941 --> 00:00:35,941
"Maybe space-time is like
two clowns

17
00:00:35,943 --> 00:00:37,073
"with their heads in a bucket,

18
00:00:37,077 --> 00:00:41,077
(Leonard:)much like Cooper
and Hofstadter."

19
00:00:41,081 --> 00:00:42,981
(Sheldon:)Can I respond now?

20
00:00:42,983 --> 00:00:44,583
(Sheldon:)Do it.

21
00:00:44,585 --> 00:00:47,785
(Sheldon:)You mess with the bull,
you get the horns.

22
00:00:47,788 --> 00:00:51,258
(Sheldon:)I'm about to show this guy
just how horny I can be.

23
00:00:55,996 --> 00:01:00,026
(Leonard:)Somebody else do it.

